    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Household chores",
     "texto": [
      "**Rydde** means tidying things up; **støvsuge** means to vacuum. **Støvsuger** can be «I vacuum» or «vacuum cleaner»: the subject and the context make the meaning clear.",
      "**Vaske opp** means «to wash up»; **oppvask** can mean the task or the dishes to be washed. For «dishwasher» you say **oppvaskmaskin**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
